- After my guard, sprint-finalizer's `writeCodeVerifiedResult` either:
  (a) is gated by `enforceHonestResultGate` before its result is consumed downstream, OR
  (b) its written .result is immediately rewritten to NO_GO by my second-pass enforcement before retro reads it
